{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-31T01:37:14.516Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-1","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"fe411f5ac7c0c68c436d07f8","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-1","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1610","claim:pm-gh1627","claim:pm-gh1628","lineage:pm-gh1610","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1610+pm-gh1627+pm-gh1628","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1610","claim:pm-gh1627","claim:pm-gh1628","lineage:pm-gh1610","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.314","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-31T01:37:14.516Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Fix: (1) the SDK declares the constant refusal boilerplate once (PM_GENERIC_REFUSAL_GUIDANCE, PM_RECOVERY_ECHO_FIELDS, isGenericRefusal*, projectLeanRecoveryPayload in agent-output-contracts, exported from ./sdk, ./sdk/runtime and ./sdk/contracts) so text and JSON lean projections agree; (2) renderGuidanceMessage takes { lean }: lean text drops the generic requirement, generic why, pm --help examples and the invocation echo while keeping next steps, specific recovery and verifier findings, and the text headline is no longer repeated under What happened when it equals the single-line message (default mode too); (3) projectLeanErrorEnvelope also drops generic required/examples and the recovery echo; (4) claim.ts resolves the holder through the new resolveItemOwnershipConflict and the refusal context carries item_id, claimed_by, claimed_at (latest assignee change from history, null when unavailable) and claim_source (claim|assignment); applyPmCliErrorContext/attachItemDiagnostics project them into GuidanceMessage, the JSON envelope and the classification, and text prints Held by: <holder> (<source> since <time>). After: text 719, --lean text 494, --json 1,299 (+127 bytes of typed holder fields), --json --lean 648; an invalid-value refusal drops 771 -> 602 under --lean. refusal.exit_code stays because refusal is the stable identity consumed by the refusal-closure tooling. Property test: six refusal codes, lean never larger than default (text and JSON) and no non-label line shared by every lean output. Gates: agent-task-token, refusal-closure, docs-skills and static quality pass; the SDK surface snapshot records the context fields and new exports."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-31T01:37:14.516Z"}],"before_hash":"2645b33ed14e946459ff699b264b23082d36a250c876de65c566360807f17219","after_hash":"2c081efabf46a6dd0344e687b5d2f6f4885301090aa9be987195a95270568bda","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"3d22274bd682a09b5857b84b676e791bc85869d877426b55392f54c9941689f6"}
