bytes, --lean text 813 -> 494, --json 1,172 -> 1,299 (typed holder fields added), --json --lean 968 -> 648; an invalid-value refusal 771 -> 602 under --lean. Property test over six refusal codes: lean never larger than default (text and JSON) and no non-label line shared by every lean output. Claim-conflict tests assert claimed_by/claim_source (claim vs assignment) and claimed_at (ISO, null on corrupt history). refusal.exit_code is retained because refusal is the stable identity used by the refusal-closure tooling. Agent-task-token, refusal-closure, docs-skills, static quality gates and the linked test run pass."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Lean refusals drop constant boilerplate and the claim holder is typed"}],"before_hash":"6edde4a04dcf68163ddbf73cd527527a41523b735d0c131d526023a07bffab9d","after_hash":"819a2557da5de4c9565d7c588b9c8673e3cc950a7dd2fc6da75079b152fdd222","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-10-31T01:52:15.075Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"5463383ac95345486e4808e3b6e372d88c3636a2ac55b5a58bb647e0e8d1d198"}
