{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-31T08:39:00.736Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"eda2446424a05ba568a1cb08","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.314","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-31T08:39:00.736Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Review follow-up on PR #1637 (CodeRabbit, 2026-10-31): three fixes to the lean refusal contract and the typed holder.\n\n1. **Lean JSON kept code-specific `why` out.** `projectLeanErrorEnvelope` destructured `why` away for every envelope, while lean text and the documented contract keep a code-specific rationale. It now drops `why` only when `isGenericRefusalWhy` is true, so `--lean --json` on `already_claimed_by` carries the claim rationale like lean text does.\n2. **Mixed example lists kept the generic `pm --help`.** `isGenericRefusalExamples` is all-or-nothing. A new SDK helper `withoutGenericRefusalExamples` (exported from `@unbrained/pm-cli/sdk`, `/sdk/contracts`, `/sdk/runtime`) filters each generic entry; text and JSON lean projections both use it and drop the field only when nothing specific remains.\n3. **Unknown holder origin reported as `assignment`.** When history is unreadable or records no assignee change, `resolveItemOwnershipConflict` now returns `source: \"unknown\"` (and `claim_source: \"unknown\"` on the refusal) instead of claiming an assignment it cannot prove. The prose keeps the `assigned to` wording. The SDK surface snapshot acknowledges the union widening; both types were introduced unreleased on this branch.\n\nCoverage: holder rendering without a recorded time or origin, generic-why removal and per-entry example filtering are asserted in `tests/unit/cli/error-guidance.spec.ts`; the corrupt-history case in `tests/unit/commands/lifecycle/claim-command.spec.ts` now expects `unknown`.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-31T08:39:00.736Z"}],"before_hash":"6d50356e3248c0fb708d66fa5c0f557d41e6548074cce0d268745192d97c9513","after_hash":"c571a5a5224d734b32122244cc288b00eae1fe18aa30d8651082ec2df05f6e70","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"70ad4426e20941a785f965e679cd3959abe8b972734d622f3fc7b6b69b8a356e"}
